              "text": "What does śvaḥ mean, and how does Sanskrit differ from Hindi here? (\"Tomorrow\"; Sanskrit keeps śvaḥ \"tomorrow\" and hyaḥ \"yesterday\" separate, where Hindi merges them into kal.)"
